_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2026-03-19T00:45:07Z","updated_at":"2026-08-07T17:19:43Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in:\n- 4.6.1 stable\n- Latest 4.7 master (456bdea954ee24e48cb562bfbf531de1cd96e371)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev (456bdea95) - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated Radeon RX 580 Series (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.21923.11000) - AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 31.90 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen a scene inherits from a GLB file, reimporting the GLB then re-saving the scene will change the unique_id on each inherited node. For version control users, this is a new source of noise in the diffs for .tscn files.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nMRP is a project with a GLB and a scene that inherits from it.\n1. Open `inherited.tscn` in a text editor, note the `unique_id` on the last line.\n2. In the editor filesystem dock, right click the GLB and reimport it.\n3. Open `inherited.tscn` in the editor and save it.\n4. Check `inherited.tscn` in a text editor again, and the `unique_id` on the last line has changed.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[unique-id-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26103030/unique-id-mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117605/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117605/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null}